### Feature Supply — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH) (SIN AUTH)
### `is_active` no se envía: solo cambia con PATCH /api/insumos/:id/deactivate
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

### PUT — reemplazo completo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/insumos/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "INS-0100",
  "nombre": "Café en grano premium",
  "unidad_medida": "kg",
  "stock_minimo": 8
}

### PATCH — parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/insumos/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock_minimo": 10
}
